sequenceDiagram
    participant AP as Ansible Process<br/>(Action Plugin)
    participant RPC as ManagerRPCClient
    participant SOCKET as Unix Socket
    participant PM as PlatformManager<br/>(Main Thread)
    participant WT as Worker Thread<br/>(ThreadingMixIn)
    participant PS as PlatformService<br/>(Shared Resource)
    participant API as AAP Gateway API
    
    Note over AP: Task Execution
    
    AP->>RPC: manager.execute(<br/>operation, module_name,<br/>ansible_data)
    
    RPC->>RPC: Convert dataclass to dict
    
    RPC->>SOCKET: service_proxy.execute(<br/>operation, module_name,<br/>data_dict)
    
    Note over SOCKET: BaseManager RPC<br/>(pickle serialization)
    
    SOCKET->>PM: RPC call received
    
    PM->>WT: Create worker thread<br/>(ThreadingMixIn)
    
    Note over WT: Thread handles this<br/>specific RPC call
    
    WT->>PS: service.execute(<br/>operation, module_name,<br/>ansible_data_dict)
    
    PS->>PS: Load version-specific classes
    PS->>PS: Forward transform<br/>(Ansible → API)
    
    PS->>API: HTTP POST/PUT/DELETE<br/>(via persistent session)
    API-->>PS: API response
    
    PS->>PS: Reverse transform<br/>(API → Ansible)
    PS-->>WT: Return ansible_result dict
    
    WT->>WT: Serialize result (pickle)
    WT->>SOCKET: Send response
    
    SOCKET->>RPC: Receive response
    RPC-->>AP: Return result dict
    
    Note over AP: Task completes

